; The segment driver of a band schedule as an ordinary SSA program: each
; schedule event becomes a view call of its stage's contraction over the rows it
; produces, reading and writing the rolling windows through bases the window's
; ring-row function names. A chain of pointwise (1x1, stride 1) stages; a read
; that would span a ring wrap is refused.

(library
 (name band_driver)
 (libraries band_schedule contraction err_trace expr fmt ssa_ir))
